      "cooked": "<p>Hi,</p>\n<p>I’m facing an issue where print preview in ERPNext shows completely blank pages.</p>\n<p>Even though the document has data, the preview (and PDF) is empty.</p>\n<h3><a name=\"p-496363-what-i-tried-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496363-what-i-tried-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>What I Tried</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Checked different documents</li>\n<li>Used browser print (Ctrl+P)</li>\n<li>Tried “Save as PDF”</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><a name=\"p-496363-issue-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496363-issue-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>Issue</h3>\n<p>Print preview loads but pages are blank.</p>\n<h3><a name=\"p-496363-environment-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496363-environment-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>Environment</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>ERPNext Version: [your version]</li>\n<li>Browser: [Chrome/Firefox]</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><a name=\"p-496363-screenshot-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496363-screenshot-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>Screenshot</h3>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/e/8e714d52618c9479ac141653a2be6077891f2888.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/8e714d52618c9479ac141653a2be6077891f2888\" title=\"Screenshot from 2026-03-25 11-05-44\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/e/8e714d52618c9479ac141653a2be6077891f2888_2_690x438.png\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2026-03-25 11-05-44\" data-base62-sha1=\"kk6y3vRNg6pE3UGF8looRJLHlRC\" width=\"690\" height=\"438\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/e/8e714d52618c9479ac141653a2be6077891f2888_2_690x438.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/e/8e714d52618c9479ac141653a2be6077891f2888_2_1035x657.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/e/8e714d52618c9479ac141653a2be6077891f2888.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F8F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-im